    "citation": "Stirling, M., Fitzgerald, M., Shaw, B., and Ross, C. (2024). New Magnitude-Area Scaling Relations for the New Zealand National Seismic Hazard Model 2022. Bulletin of the Seismological Society of America, 114(1), 137-149. doi: 10.1785/0120230114",
    "description": "Mw-area scaling relations developed for the New Zealand National Seismic Hazard Model 2022 (NZ NSHM 2022). Two sets of relations are provided: the NZ NSHM 2022 final set (adjusted for historical NZ observations and USGS practice) and an alternative set reflecting the quantitative scoring of published relations more directly. All equations are of the form Mw = log10(A) + C.",
